            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "1 Introduction"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                119,
                304,
                315,
                322
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "In this document the required process for installation of the seakeeping solver is described. Please note that OceanWave3D-Seakeeping code is making use of several external libraries. These libraries must be built and installed before the seakeeping code is compiled and used. The main library is called Overture (Brown et al., 1999). It is assumed here that the Overture library has already been installed. For Overture installation procedure, please refer to the relevant document in this folder. It is also recommended to install the PETSc library as it has been explained in the Overture installation guide. The seakeeping code is also using the GNU Scientific Library (gsl) (Gough, 2009) whose installation will be described described in this note. For all other required libraries please refer to the documentation for the Overture installation in this folder."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                119,
                336,
                887,
                495
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2 Building the gsl library"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                119,
                519,
                443,
                539
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "This library is a collection of routines for the numerical calculation in C and C++. In the seakeeping code it is used for instance to perform the fft, least-square fitting, complex number operations and so on. The gsl library can be downloaded from https://ftp.gnu.org/gnu/gsl/. Note that he seakeeping code is written based on gsl version 1.16. For installation:"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                119,
                551,
                885,
                615
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "tar xzf gsl-1.16.tar.gz"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                119,
                627,
                307,
                643
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "cd gsl-1.16"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                119,
                649,
                221,
                664
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "./configure"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                121,
                671,
                213,
                687
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "make"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                121,
                694,
                168,
                707
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "make check"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                121,
                715,
                221,
                728
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "make install"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                121,
                737,
                226,
                751
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "For more information regarding the installation process for gsl refer to the INSTALL file in the gsl library folder."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                119,
                765,
                885,
                797
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
